<title>UK: Bank of England sets rates on index-linked gilts.</title>
<headline>Bank of England sets rates on index-linked gilts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Thursday it had set the next payable interest rates on index-linked Treasury stocks due 1998, 2004 and 2020.</p>
<p>The rates are as follows --</p>
<p>					Rate of Interest    Payment Date</p>
<p>    4-5/8 pct IL stock due 1998    2.6109	   April 27, 1997</p>
<p>    4-3/8 pct IL stock due 2004    2.4698	   April 21, 1997</p>
<p>    2-1/2 pct IL stock due 2020    2.3066	   April 16, 1997</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
